{
  "id": "RAW_845d65361f",
  "title": "Hy4 flash 本地部署：让大模型跑在个人设备上",
  "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkwODU2OTQyNQ==&mid=2247499086&idx=1&sn=2621d76c5d058dc9b5b0236f602c4895",
  "date": "2026-11-25 14:42:00",
  "author": "腾讯混元",
  "siteName": "腾讯混元",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261125114257_353bdc9.jpeg\" style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: left;margin: 3pt 8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">今天，我们通过大模型压缩加速工具箱 AngelSlim 开源&nbsp;</span><a class=\"normal_text_link mp_article_text_link\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkwODU2OTQyNQ==&amp;mid=2247499006&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=519fe6d2987d39a281519089539a1f8d&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">Hy4 flash</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">&nbsp;GGUF 量化权重及配套推理代码。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;text-align: left;\"><span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">经过压缩和运行优化，</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">Hy4 flash&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">这款总参数量为 224B 的模型可以部署到个人设备上</span></span></span><span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">——</span></span></span><span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">体积最小的版本，权重仅约为原始版本的 30%。此外，借助优化后的 Strata offload 框架，模型也可以在 64 GB 的 Mac mini 等设备上运行。实测数据显示，在配备 48 GB 显存的设备上，模型生成速度最高可达每秒 89 &nbsp;个 token。</span></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" type=\"block\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261125114257_f4bbb5e.gif\"></p>\n  <div style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;text-autospace:normal;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-align:justify;\">\n   <div style=\"margin: 10px 0% 8px;text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;width: 100%;border-left: 3px solid rgb(6, 50, 253);border-bottom-left-radius: 0px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 8px;align-self: flex-start;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"margin: 0px 8px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>在个人设备上，能做什么</span></strong></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"text-align: left;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">我们已在 RTX&nbsp;Spark&nbsp;128&nbsp;GB、DGX&nbsp;Spark&nbsp;128&nbsp;GB&nbsp;、M5 Max Mac 128 GB、64 GB Mac mini，以及搭载 4090D 的设备上完成 Hy4 flash 的本地部署。</span></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: left;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">处理长材料时，读入和生成速度都很重要。例如，</span></span><span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">可以把两版方案放进同一轮对话，让模型找出改动，再追问哪些变化会影响下周上线；也可以在编辑器里选中刚修改的函数，让它起草测试用例。</span></span></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: left;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">在不同设备和测试条件下，我们得到以下结果：</span></span></span></p>\n  <ul style=\"list-style-type: circle;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-1\">\n   <li>\n    <p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">48 GB 显存设备：</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">在 10K 上下文测试中，平均每秒生成 89 个 token。</span></span></span></p>\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">M5 Max Mac：</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">Q3_K 版本在 32K 上下文测试中，每秒生成 47 个 token。</span></span></span></p>\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">RTX&nbsp;Spark&nbsp;128&nbsp;GB：</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">SPARK-4Bit-Fast 版本在 16K 上下文测试中，每秒读入 717 个 token、生成 33 个 token。</span></span></span></p>\n   </li>\n  </ul>\n  <div style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;text-autospace:normal;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-align:justify;\">\n   <div style=\"margin: 10px 0% 8px;text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;width: 100%;border-left: 3px solid rgb(6, 50, 253);border-bottom-left-radius: 0px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 8px;align-self: flex-start;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"margin: 0px 8px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>模型权重从约 410 GiB 缩至约 126 GiB</span></strong></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;text-align: left;\"><span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">Hy4 flash 的原始权重约为 410.27 GiB。为适配不同设备，我们开源了多个量化版本，包括通用的 Q4_K_M、在 M5 Max 上完成实测的 Q3_K、体积更小的 IQ2-AH，以及面向 Spark 的两个 4-bit 版本。</span></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;text-align: left;\"><span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">其中，Q3_K 的权重为 144.70 GiB，约为原始版本的 35%；IQ2-AH 的权重为 125.73 GiB，比原始版本减少约 285 GiB，存储占用降低约 69%。</span></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" height=\"235.372\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;width: 545px;height: 212px;\" width=\"604.733\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261125114257_04634bf.png\"></span></p>\n  <div style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;text-autospace:normal;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-align:justify;\">\n   <div style=\"margin: 10px 0% 8px;text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;width: 100%;border-left: 3px solid rgb(6, 50, 253);border-bottom-left-radius: 0px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 8px;align-self: flex-start;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"margin: 0px 8px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>测评：压缩后，模型多项任务表现与原模型差距不超过 0.4 分</span></strong></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;text-align: left;\"><span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">我们比较了量化前后模型在演示文稿生成、软件工程和自动化任务中的表现。在四项评测中，Q3_K 与原模型的得分差距均不超过 0.4 分。例如，在 DeepSWE v1.1 中，得分从原模型的 64.6 分变为 64.3 分。</span></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;text-align: left;\"><span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">面向 Spark 的 SPARK-4Bit 在 PPTGenBench 中得到 54.1 分，与原模型相差 0.1分。这些评测结果表明，相应量化版本在所测任务中的得分与原模型接近。那么，压缩后模型在做 PPT、写代码这些日常任务上的的表现如何？</span></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: left;margin: 3pt 8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">我们比较了量化前后模型在演示文稿生成、软件工程和自动化任务中的表现。在四项评测中，Q3_K 与原模型的得分差距均</span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0pt;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;\"><span>不超过 0.4 分。例如，在 DeepSWE v1.1 中，得分从原模型的 64.6 分变为 64.3 分。面向 Spark 的 SPARK-4Bit 在 PPTGenBench 中得到 54.1 分，与原模型相差 0.1 分。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: left;margin: 3pt 8px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0pt;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;\"><span>这些评测结果表明，量化版本模型在所测任务中的得分与原模型接近。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" height=\"376.221\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;width: 492.733px;height: 376.221px;\" width=\"492.733\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261125114257_ca27dcc.png\"></span></p>\n  <div style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;text-autospace:normal;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-align:justify;\">\n   <div style=\"margin: 10px 0% 8px;text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;width: 100%;border-left: 3px solid rgb(6, 50, 253);border-bottom-left-radius: 0px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 8px;align-self: flex-start;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"margin: 0px 8px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>为不同内存设备优化运行方式</span></strong></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;text-align: left;\"><span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">压缩后的 Hy4 flash 仍有上百 GiB 的权重。为让它在不同个人设备上运行，AngelSlim 针对大内存设备和内存受限设备，分别优化了推理方式。</span></span></span></p>\n  <h4 style=\"margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;text-align: left;\"><span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">1</span></span></span><span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">、</span></span></span><span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">大内存设备：提高生成速度</span></span></span></h4>\n  <p style=\"margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;text-align: left;\"><span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">Hy4 flash是一个包含224B 参数量的模型</span></span></span><span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。对于内存足以容纳完整计算权重的设备，可以通过 llama.cpp 运行压缩版本。我们为 llama.cpp 增加了 Hy4 flash 模型结构支持，并针对 M5 Max 和 Spark 做了优化。</span></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" type=\"block\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261125114257_abf2c34.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;text-align: left;\"><span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">在 Apple Silicon 上，修复计算图复用问题、优化解码计算并合并常用运算后，单路生成速度从每秒 27 个 token 提升到 39 个；进一步使用 DFly2 推测解码后，达到每秒 47 个，整体约为优化前的 1.7 倍。</span></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;text-align: left;\"><span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">在 RTX&nbsp;Spark&nbsp;128&nbsp;GB 上，调整计算方式并优化权重预加载后，生成速度从每秒 13.8 个 token 提升到 28.8 个；叠加 DFly2 后，代码场景下的输出速度可达每秒 40 多个 token。</span></span></span></p>\n  <h4 style=\"margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">2</span></span></span><span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">、</span></span></span><span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">内存受限设备：减少等待和数据搬运</span></span></span></h4>\n  <p style=\"margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;text-align: left;\"><span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">即使 Engram 权重已按需从 SSD 读取，压缩后近百 G 的计算权重仍超出许多端侧设备的可用显存。为此，我们为端侧推理引擎 Strata 适配了 Hy4 flash，通过 offload 按需加载计算权重，降低部署门槛。我们还分别优化了 Prefill 和 Decode 的计算路径，减少权重搬运带来的开销。</span></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;text-align: left;\"><span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">在 Prefill 阶段，长输入会被切分为多个 chunk，对此我们沿用了Strata的按层推进计算顺序，加载一层权重后直接处理多个 chunk后再进入下一层，避免为每个 chunk 重复加载同一层权重。</span></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" type=\"block\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261125114257_c489ed0.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;text-align: left;\"><span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">而到了 Decode 阶段，内存带宽成了更大的瓶颈。为了尽可能的减小权重搬运的数据量，我们在 Strata 上实现了计算动态分流，结合当前设备的运行速率、硬件等因素，针对 Cache miss 的场景，动态分流一定比例的专家在 CPU 上完成计算，最小化等待的时间。最后采用自研 DFly2 投机解码技术与 Strata 的专项适配大幅提高生成速度，将性能提升到极致。</span></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;text-align: left;\"><span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">通过这些压缩和运行优化，Hy4 flash 得以在个人电脑等算力有限的设备上运行，为本地处理工作材料提供了更多选择。</span></span></span></p>\n  <h4 style=\"margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;\"><span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">附：模型下载地址</span></span></span></h4>\n  <ul style=\"list-style-type: circle;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-1\">\n   <li style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n    <p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;font-weight: bold;\">GitHub：</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Tencent/AngelSlim\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/Tencent/AngelSlim</a></span></span></span></p>\n   </li>\n   <li style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n    <p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;font-weight: bold;\">Hugging Face：</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/AngelSlim/Hy4-flash-GGUF\" target=\"_blank\">https://huggingface.co/AngelSlim/Hy4-flash-GGUF</a></span></span></span></p>\n   </li>\n   <li style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n    <p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;font-weight: bold;\">ModelScope：</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><a href=\"https://www.modelscope.cn/models/AngelSlim/Hy4-flash-GGUF\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.modelscope.cn/models/AngelSlim/Hy4-flash-GGUF</a></span></span></span></p>\n   </li>\n  </ul>\n  <p style=\"display: none;\"></p>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "腾讯混元通过 AngelSlim 工具箱开源 Hy4 flash 量化模型，实现 224B 参数模型在个人设备上的部署，支持多种量化版本并在实测中达到每秒 89 个 token 的生成速度。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "腾讯混元通过 AngelSlim 工具箱开源 Hy4 flash 量化模型，实现 224B 参数模型在个人设备上的部署，支持多种量化版本并在实测中达到每秒 89 个 token 的生成速度。",
  "summary": "本文介绍腾讯混元团队通过 AngelSlim 工具箱开源的 Hy4 flash 量化模型。该模型总参数量为 224B，经过压缩后权重仅约为原始版本的 30%（从 410.27 GiB 缩至约 126 GiB），支持在个人设备上部署运行。文章详细阐述了多种量化版本（包括 Q4_K_M、Q3_K、IQ2-AH 及 Spark 专用 4-bit 版本）的存储占用情况，并提供了针对大内存设备（如 RTX Spark 128 GB、M5 Max Mac）和内存受限设备的优化方案。实测数据显示，在 48 GB 显存设备上实现每秒 89 个 token 的生成速度，64 GB Mac mini 也可运行。此外，文章指出压缩后模型在演示文稿生成、软件工程等任务上的表现与原模型差距不超过 0.4 分，验证了量化后的实用性。",
